<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτοπτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of an eye-witness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίστις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Scymn.
					129
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λογικός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				16.600
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					13.350
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>concerned with a direct vision of divinity,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεκανομαντ&lt;ε&gt;<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ία</span></span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>PMag.Par.</u>
				1.221
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐθ-</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">;
				αὐ. λεκάνης ἐνέργεια</span> a <i>personal and
			active</i> power of dish-divination, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.Astr.
			</span></i> in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cat.Cod.Astr.</u>
				8
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>).<i><span class="en">
				136.10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PMag.Lond.</u>
					46.53
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				121.335
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεῖξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					2.6
				</span></i>
			.</div>
